<div class="card">
  <div class="card-body">
    <h2 class="card-title">About This Project</h2>
    <p>
      The Online Survey System is a web application that lets a registered user create surveys,
      add questions of different types, publish them, and collect answers from anyone who opens
      the shared link.
    </p>
    <p>
      Every survey belongs to the user who created it. Questions and their options are stored in
      separate database tables, so the collected answers can be grouped and counted directly with
      SQL when the results are calculated.
    </p>

    <h5 class="mt-4">Built With</h5>
    <ul>
      <li>Node.js and Express for the server</li>
      <li>EJS templates with Bootstrap and Font Awesome for the interface</li>
      <li>MySQL with the Sequelize ORM for storing the data</li>
      <li>Joi for validating everything that is submitted</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>
